#: student_registration/templates/registration-pilot/registry.html:1106
msgid ""
"Currently ATM Cards can only be issued for those over the age of 18. We are "
"working on a solution for this. You can continue the Registration Process so "
"we have your information in case a solution is found. However, until then "
"you will not receive payments."
msgstr ""

